{"id":"0c88d7bf21633cb8","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-dehn-surgery.md","title":"Dehn Surgery","display":"df-dehn-surgery — Dehn Surgery","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-dehn-surgery","aliases":["58-df-dehn-surgery"],"display":"df-dehn-surgery — Dehn Surgery","depends_on":["[[58-df-knot]]","[[58-df-link-complement]]","[[58-df-manifold]]","[[58-df-homeomorphism]]","[[58-df-knot-peripheral-data.md]]","[[58-df-quotient-gluing.md]]","[[58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-dehn-surgery"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-dehn-surgery</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dehn-surgery — Dehn Surgery"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ccaaf599ec318a33\" href=\"?note=ccaaf599ec318a33\" title=\"58-df-knot\">58-df-knot</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e56b42300668cf3b\" href=\"?note=e56b42300668cf3b\" title=\"58-df-link-complement\">58-df-link-complement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"58-df-manifold\">58-df-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"58-df-homeomorphism\">58-df-homeomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ba4592cee3b1b3f0\" href=\"?note=ba4592cee3b1b3f0\" title=\"58-df-knot-peripheral-data.md\">58-df-knot-peripheral-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"de46efac56b1e2dc\" href=\"?note=de46efac56b1e2dc\" title=\"58-df-quotient-gluing.md\">58-df-quotient-gluing.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" href=\"?note=fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" title=\"58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md\">58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,k\\in V\">\\(M,k\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DehnSurgery}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DehnSurgery}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^r,V_0,T_0,\\tau_{V_0},\\tau_{T_0}\">\\(S^r,V_0,T_0,\\tau_{V_0},\\tau_{T_0}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial_3N\">\\(\\partial_3N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{int}_3(N)\">\\(\\operatorname{int}_3(N)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_N\">\\(W_N\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_A\">\\(\\tau_A\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ba4592cee3b1b3f0\" href=\"?note=ba4592cee3b1b3f0\" title=\"58-df-knot-peripheral-data.md\">58-df-knot-peripheral-data.md</a> 中的显式集合、拓扑及函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TubularNeighborhood}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TubularNeighborhood}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PeripheralBasis}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PeripheralBasis}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeridianImage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeridianImage}_S\\)</span> 的参数数目分别保留为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2,4,2\">\\(2,4,2\\)</span>；其定义以及同一邻域上的补充谓词均在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ba4592cee3b1b3f0\" href=\"?note=ba4592cee3b1b3f0\" title=\"58-df-knot-peripheral-data.md\">58-df-knot-peripheral-data.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GluingQuotient}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GluingQuotient}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"de46efac56b1e2dc\" href=\"?note=de46efac56b1e2dc\" title=\"58-df-quotient-gluing.md\">58-df-quotient-gluing.md</a> 的加标签商集和商拓扑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 仍是商集本身，而非同胚类或带结构元组。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PeripheralBasisForNeighborhood}\">\\(\\mathrm{PeripheralBasisForNeighborhood}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ba4592cee3b1b3f0\" href=\"?note=ba4592cee3b1b3f0\" title=\"58-df-knot-peripheral-data.md\">58-df-knot-peripheral-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomologyLinearCombination}\">\\(\\mathrm{HomologyLinearCombination}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" href=\"?note=fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" title=\"58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md\">58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"58-df-homeomorphism\">58-df-homeomorphism</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Manifold}\">\\(\\mathrm{Manifold}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"58-df-manifold\">58-df-manifold</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dehn\\text{-}surgery\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DehnSurgery}_S(M,k,p,q)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Knot}_S(k)\\land p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\gcd(p,q)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists K,N,\\phi,\\mu_K,\\lambda_K,a,\\tau_M\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nK=k[S^1]\\land\\mathrm{TubularNeighborhood}_S(N,K)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{PeripheralBasis}_S(\\mu_K,\\lambda_K,\\partial_3N,K)\n\\land\\mathrm{PeripheralBasisForNeighborhood}_S(\\mu_K,\\lambda_K,N,K)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(\\phi,T_0,\\tau_{T_0},\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{HomologyLinearCombination}_S(a,p,\\mu_K,q,\\lambda_K,\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N},1)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeridianImage}_S(\\phi,a)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{GluingQuotient}_S(M,\\tau_M,W_N,\\tau_{W_N},V_0,\\tau_{V_0},T_0,\\phi)\n\\land\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,3)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dehn\\text{-}surgery\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DehnSurgery}_S(M,k,p,q)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Knot}_S(k)\\land p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\gcd(p,q)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists K,N,\\phi,\\mu_K,\\lambda_K,a,\\tau_M\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nK=k[S^1]\\land\\mathrm{TubularNeighborhood}_S(N,K)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{PeripheralBasis}_S(\\mu_K,\\lambda_K,\\partial_3N,K)\n\\land\\mathrm{PeripheralBasisForNeighborhood}_S(\\mu_K,\\lambda_K,N,K)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(\\phi,T_0,\\tau_{T_0},\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{HomologyLinearCombination}_S(a,p,\\mu_K,q,\\lambda_K,\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N},1)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeridianImage}_S(\\phi,a)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{GluingQuotient}_S(M,\\tau_M,W_N,\\tau_{W_N},V_0,\\tau_{V_0},T_0,\\phi)\n\\land\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,3)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>经线、纬线、边界同调映射和补空间使用同一个管状邻域。系数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p,q)\">\\((p,q)\\)</span> 因而约束实际粘合映射。</li>\n<li>商拓扑由粘合投影的逆像条件唯一确定。这里不将原有商集输出扩大为任意同胚副本。</li>\n<li>所有曾在正文中用 “where” 解释的内容已在依赖文件的断言中给出；本节不承担定义条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","le